<h4><strong>Benefits:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>Natural Warm Hue: Adds a soft peachy-pink glow for a fresh and youthful appearance.</li>
<li>Lightweight Formula: Comfortable for all-day wear without clogging pores.</li>
<li>Buildable Coverage: Achieve your desired intensity, from subtle to bold.</li>
<li>Long-lasting Wear: Smudge-proof and fade-resistant formula keeps you glowing for hours.</li>
<li>Multi-use Product: Can be used on both cheeks and lips for a cohesive look.</li>
</ul>
<h4><strong>How to use:</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>Prepare Your Skin: Start with a clean, moisturized face. Apply primer or foundation if desired.</li>
<li>Apply: Dab a small amount of the blush onto the apples of your cheeks using the applicator or your fingertips.</li>
<li>Blend: Smoothly blend the product in an upward motion using your fingers, a makeup sponge, or a brush.</li>
<li>Layer: For a more intense color, add additional layers gradually.</li>
