<li>Medical device</li>
<li>For treating the upper and lower airways, for colds, asthma, respiratory diseases</li>
<li>High proportion of respirable particles enables targeted treatment of the upper and lower airways</li>
<li>Easy to use thanks to single-button operation</li>
<li>Hygienic usage as the device and year pack are suitable for re-use once properly prepared</li>
<li>The integrated LED indicator displays the operating status (blue: ready for operation)</li>
<li>Easy &amp; hygienic cleaning thanks to removable elements</li>
<li>All medication that is suitable and approved for inhalation can be inhaled. For advice please consult a medical practitione
<li>Extensive year pack included in delivery</li>
<li>Short inhalation time thanks to high nebulisation performance</li>
</ul>
