<div class=""highlights__contentLeft__table"">
<ul>
<li>Voice output of measurements in the following languages: DE, FR, IT, NL</li>
<li>Individually adjustable voice output, can be deactivated</li>
<li>Clear, easy-to-read display</li>
<li>Scan &amp; Save: Digitally record blood pressure values in the “beurer Health Manager Pro” app</li>
<li>Fully automatic blood pressure and pulse measurement on the upper arm</li>
<li>Automatic pressure preselection and deflation</li>
<li>Risk indicator: With coloured scale for classifying measurements</li>
<li>Arrhythmia detection: Warns of possible cardiac arrhythmia</li>
<li>Average value of all stored measurements and the morning/evening blood pressure calculated for the last 7 days</li>
<li>2 users with 60 measurements each</li>
<li>Incl. cuff for upper arm circumferences of 22–36 cm</li>
<li>Incl. storage bag</li>
<li>Incl. blood pressure record for documenting the measured values</li>
<li>XL cuff (35–44 cm) available as an accessory</li>
<li>Medical device</li>
</ul>
